{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund the UK Youth Parliament beyond 2027",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "We ask the Government to secure and restore proper funding for the UK Youth Parliament beyond 2027, so it can continue from 2027 onwards and give young people across the UK a meaningful voice in democracy. All we ask is for funding so the UK Youth Parliament can continue for future years to come!",
